Css Notes
-------------------
1.Css stands for cascading style sheet.
2.It was developed by W3c org.released in 1996 year.
3.By using you can style,design the webpages.
4.You want working with css no need special software.(vs code+browser)
5.Css current version is css3.
6.Css exntension is .css.


How many ways write the css code?(FAQ)
-----------------------------------------
you can write the css code mainly  three ways

1.inline css:
--------------------
inline css means write the css inside html element using "style " attribute.

2.internal css
-----------------------
internal css mens write the css within html file  using <style> tag where head part.


3.external css
-------------------

external css means write css code  separate file like "hello.css".
that  file is connect to html page using <link> tag.



Selectors(FAQ)
------------------------
css selector are used to select the html element for styling.
you want select the html element css provide number of selectors.
but they divided into five categories.
---------------------------------------------

1.simple selectors
2.relational selectors
3.pseudo-class seletors
4.pseudo-element selectors
5.attribute selectors


1.simple selectors
-------------------------------

simple selectors are used to select the element based on their elementname ,id name, classname
